% SPDX-License-Identifier: EUPL-1.2
% =====================================================================
% parameters.clausal -- the PROVENANCE records of the sourced figures of
% eu/ai_act/provider_side_duties. PROVENANCE ONLY: this file references each figure by
% name and holds no value, and the logic modules do not import it.
%
% If parameters-sources.yaml is the COMMISSIONING REGISTER (its first line
% says so), then for EACH of its keys:
%   1. the VALUE is a fact in the determination slice that READS it
%      (that slice's .clausal file), never here;
%   2. this file holds its provenance record, a fact:
%        parameter_source(<key>, [label-'...', ref-'...', verbatim-'...']).
%      with the verbatim pair OMITTED while the yaml entry is
%      `status: unverified`.
% Otherwise this file holds no records at the baseline.
%
% This order's parameters-sources.yaml is the empty template, not a
% commissioning register, so this file holds no records. The statutory
% figures of this order (the dates of application 2 February 2025,
% 2 December 2027 and 2 August 2028 of Art 113; the compliance days
% 31 December 2030 and 2 August 2030 of Art 111; the 10-year periods of
% Art 18(1), Art 22(3)(b) and Art 23(5); the six-month minimum of
% Art 19(1)) are declared once, each with its cite(Key), in the slice
% provider_side_duties.clausal that reads them.
% =====================================================================

:- module(parameters, []).

:- end_module(parameters).
